      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't waste 15s on small mice; sometimes a 7 or 8 is enough to win a +3 mouse.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Vultures are dangerous; sometimes you have to burn a mid-range card just to be safe.',
